groups:
  - name: garage-admin-metrics
    rules:
      - alert: GarageDiskFillingUp
        expr: |
          garage_local_disk_avail / garage_local_disk_total < 0.2
        for: 30m
        labels:
          severity: warning
        annotations:
          summary: Garage data disk is {{ $value | humanizePercentage }} full on {{ $labels.node }}
          description: Garage's data disk has less than 20% available. The ledger's >80% threshold (docs/storage-ledger.md). Check the node's disk usage and whether the Longhorn volume or the underlying pve thin pool is filling. A full disk makes Garage go read-only — the 2026-08-24 meta wipe started this way.
      - alert: GarageTableEmpty
        expr: |
          table_size == 0 and max_over_time(table_size[24h]) > 0
        for: 5m
        labels:
          severity: warning
        annotations:
          summary: Garage table {{ $labels.table_name }} is empty on {{ $labels.node }}
          description: 'A Garage meta table that should hold data reports zero size. This is the pattern from the 2026-08-24 meta wipe (docs/incidents/2026-08-24-pve-thin-pool-garage-meta-wipe.md): the LMDB came back with empty tables after a hard VM stop. Check Garage''s health (`garage status`), the meta volume, and the pod logs. If multiple tables are empty simultaneously the meta store may need recovery from the snapshot belt (metadataAutoSnapshotInterval: 6h, snapshots in /mnt/data/meta_snapshots).'
      - alert: GarageAdminMetricsAbsent
        expr: |
          absent(garage_local_disk_total) or absent(table_size)
        for: 30m
        labels:
          severity: warning
        annotations:
          summary: Garage admin-metrics families are absent — the disk/table belts are blind
          description: The garage-admin-metrics belts (GarageDiskFillingUp, GarageTableEmpty) read garage_local_disk_total and table_size, and at least one family is absent from Prometheus — the scrape is not working (ServiceMonitor selector, metrics token, or a metric-name drift), so those belts cannot fire regardless of Garage's state. Fix the scrape; do not silence this without confirming both families exist.
